comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-04T09:30:24.732Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check 2026-08-04: searched all statuses for linked-test schema sandbox, PM_PATH merge-driver warnings, non-PM benchmark context drift, direct-versus-linked parity, and self-sandboxing repository commands. Closed pm-uawujr fixed package prepare source fallback; closed pm-oslr delivered linked execution; open pm-ed28wi owns trust/allowlisting. None owns the reproduced semantic parity failure for already-sandboxed non-PM commands."
body: "Design a deterministic execution-context contract for linked tests. Detect commands that use scripts/run-tests.mjs or self-contained benchmark fixtures; do not inject an empty schema PM_PATH when it changes their meaning, or require and persist an explicit per-test context mode with a clear add-time diagnostic. The output must show the effective context before execution and recommend the correct bounded retry. Preserve the rule that tests never read or write real repository PM data."
